{'<p>Your key is set up. Connect with:</p><pre>' + e(ssh_cmd) + '</pre>' if st.get('ssh') else
 '<p class="mut">No SSH key yet. Paste one to get terminal access (<code>cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub</code> on your computer).</p>'}
