<p class="sub">Then: <code>{e(ssh_cmd)}</code>, and <code>box</code> shows your usage, ports and limits.</p></details>""")
    out.append(f"""<h2>Good to know</h2><ul>
<li>Projects untouched for {e(CFG['PROJECT_TTL_DAYS'])} days are deleted. Ask your agent to put them on GitHub.</li>
<li>Bookmark this page. Come back here any time to log in again or get a new T3 link.</li>
<li>Stuck? Ask your agent in T3 Code. It knows how this machine works.</li></ul>""")
    if st.get("ok") is False and st.get("error"):
        out.append(f"<p class='err'>{e(st['error'])}</p>")
    return page("you", "<div class='box'>" + "".join(out) + "</div>")


